fn gui_sfnt_glyf_simple_point_stream_with_tables %fn &ByteBuf fn GuiSfntTableRecord fn GuiSfntTableRecord fn GuiSfntTableRecord fn GuiSfntMetrics fn GuiGlyphId Result GuiSfntSimpleGlyphPointStream GuiSfntParseError \bytes\head\loca\glyf\metrics\glyph:
